  "id": "memory-enhancing-drug",
  "term": "memory-enhancing drug",
  "definition": "A memory-enhancing drug is a substance that improves memory or other aspects of cognitive performance. In this source, the term is used for a compound that lessens experimentally induced memory deficits and may have value against cognitive impairment linked to neurodegenerative disease.",
